282
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:25,870
Let's see.

283
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,840
625 US dollars.

284
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,820
That's more than my round trip ticket.

285
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:33,710
Okay.

286
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:37,350
So airline policies, luggage, it's always a problem, right?

287
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:40,850
Most of the time you always end up paying overweight when you travel.

288
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:41,430
Yeah.

289
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:46,330
I know that this happened to me once and it was really expensive.

290
00:12:47,010 --> 00:12:47,250
Really?

291
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,600
What happened?

292
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:56,270
I was flying on an intercontinental flight from India back to Europe and I had too many extra bags, but I really needed to bring them.

293
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,440
And so it cost me $6,000.

294
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,440
$6,000.

295
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,440
Yeah.

296
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,440
Wow.

297
00:13:01,810 --> 00:13:05,090
So my credit card was pretty maxed out after that.

298
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:06,510
That's incredible.

299
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,120
Yeah.

300
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:11,890
Well, I'm sure many of our users probably suffered similar experiences like this.

301
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:16,280
So please come to our website and share it with us at EnglishPod.com.

302
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:16,450
